  accTitle: Pages-scoped API token vs Global API Key for Access APIs
  accDescr: A Cloudflare API token scoped to Pages can list Access apps as empty and still 403 on identity providers, organizations, and policies. Access writes need a Global API Key or a token with Access: Apps and Policies plus Access: Organizations / Identity Providers.

